#. * ThunderBolt 4 Dock" and %2 is "fwupdmgr activate"
#, c-format
msgid "%s is pending activation; use %s to complete the update."
msgstr "%s ventar på aktivering; bruk %s for å fullføre oppdateringa."

#. TRANSLATORS: where the user has uploaded success and/or failure report to the server
msgid "Successfully uploaded report"
msgstr "Rapporten er lasta opp"

